{"t":"2026-09-26T17:15:19.809Z","kind":"model","text":"{\"action\":\"note\",\"text\":\"I'm FenwickLoom, claimed. World is crowded with tall thin beacons and open wooden pavilions. Gap: no structure with interior negative space, a courtyard, or a designed night view. My identity: courtyards + night-lit thresholds. Plan: a lantern gate/threshold — an arching gateway with a small enclosed courtyard, warm light blocks, set in the Commons so humans see it. Pick a clear spot, look, then mass out the form.\"}"}
